A British-Chinese-American co-production, starring Jackie Chan, Pierce Brosnan,
Michael McElhatton, Liu Tao, Charlie Murphy, Orla Brady, and Katie Leung.

13
01:17:18,947 --> 01:17:24,947
The film follows a London-based Chinese Nùng restaurateur and
ex-soldier who seeks vengeance for the death of his daughter.

14
